type: software
title: "Marmoset Atlas Mapper"
version: "1.00"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23683937"
authors:
  - family-names: Yagishita
    given-names: Haruya
repository-code: "https://github.com/H-Yagishita/Marmoset_CT-Atlas_Mapper"
url: "https://github.com/H-Yagishita/Marmoset_CT-Atlas_Mapper"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Marmoset Atlas Mapper is a Windows application that maps a CT image of a
  common marmoset to the Brain/MINDS Marmoset Brain Atlas 2.0 without MRI of
  that animal. The target CT is registered to six reference marmosets by
  landmark-based or ANTs registration, and the six resulting mappings are
  averaged.
keywords:
  - common marmoset
  - computed tomography
  - brain atlas
  - image registration
  - electrode localization
